sentences.text:
The Committal Court is directed to release the petitioners - accused Nos.1 to 3 on bail, in Crime No.199/2023 registered for the offences punishable under Sections 498A and 306 read with Section 34 of IPC, by the Humnabad Police Station, Dist:
Bidar, subject to the following conditions:-
(i) Petitioners shall execute personal bonds for a sum of Rs.2,00,000/- each with two sureties each for the likesum to the satisfaction of the Trial Court;
NC: 2023:KHC-K:8596 (ii) Petitioners shall not indulge in similar offences strictly;
(iii) Petitioners shall not tamper with the prosecution witnesses directly/ indirectly;
(iv) Petitioners shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Court without prior permission of the trial Court.
